    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d850">

                <pb facs="0787" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14553.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Silliman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-12T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1915—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Brazilian Minister, Mexico City, reports March 10, information following outrages
                    committed by Constitutionalists: house George Bryant, American citizen, Coyoacan
                    assailed; dairy of Costello Brothers, American citizens, looted March 10, loss
                    half million; Swedish subject killed March 9, in his own garden without the
                    least apparent reason; five Spaniards killed within the last four days; French
                    citizen robbed; prominent Mexican killed and chauffeur wounded because car not
                    stopped as promptly as desired; twenty-five policemen killed because they would
                    not enlist in army.</p>
                <p>Spanish Minister, this capital, reports killing three Spaniards, Mexico City, and
                    states that all efforts to obtain punishment criminals have proven useless.</p>
                <p>Bring all above to attention Carranza and ask to be informed immediately what
                    action he purposes to take to punish the perpetrators of these crimes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
